* Auto-generated testbench for RC filter: R713/C713
* Type: low-pass, expected fc = 15915.5 Hz
* Model: ideal passives (exact for RC)


R713 NTC_C_RAW NTC_PHASE_C 1k

C713 NTC_PHASE_C 0 10n

